},"body":"﻿Confirmed on the current stacked build. Place `cell-basic` at (10,10) and, while its shell is still pending, submit an ordinary `PlaceBuildOrder` full-square wall at (11,17), the sole outside approach to its south door at (11,16). The wall is approved; the Cell can later complete with its entrance sealed. The same red result occurs when the pending Cell is saved and restored before the wall command.\n\nExisting doorway checks reject a wall that predates a plan (#1661/#1673). #1692/#1694 covers another template placed after the plan, but not an ordinary wall command. Expected: refuse the late wall before spending or building, preserve the paid Cell and allow unrelated neighbouring walls.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woogitsu/lockstate/issues/1696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woogitsu/lockstate/issues/1696/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}